{
  vertexes: [
    {
      id: "1"
      L: Page
      P: {
        public: true
        fns: return { enabled: () => true }
        title: Documentation - Attendra
        url: /docs
        key: Documentation
        props: '''return { isNoPermissionCheck: true };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "2"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id{ max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: ${args.theme.var.spacing?.lg || "2rem"}; color:${args.theme.var.color.text}; }
@media (max-width: 768px){ ._id{ padding:${args.theme.var.spacing?.md || "1rem"}; } }`;'''
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as: "main" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "3"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 1
        componentName: Html
        props: '''return { as:"h1", text:"Documentation" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "4"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 2
        componentName: Html
        textType: markdown
        css: '''return `._id{ margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0; color:${args.theme.var.color.text_light_500}; line-height: 1.6; }`;'''
        text: This guide explains how to use **Attendra** in plain language.
        props: '''return { as: "div" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "5"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        displayOrder: 3
        componentName: Html
        textType: markdown
        css: '''return `._id{ margin: 0; color:${args.theme.var.color.text}; line-height: 1.75; }`;'''
        text:
          '''## Pages

- **Dashboard** (`/app`): quick view of who’s present and recent activity.
- **Employees** (`/employees`): add/edit staff, roles, active/inactive.
- **Roles** (`/roles`): define role keys for assignments.
- **Time Logs** (`/time-logs`): clock in/out timestamps and total hours.
- **Settings** (`/settings`): timezone, late threshold, auto clock-out.

## Staff portal

Staff authenticate via your shop’s portal sign-in URL (open **Portal Url** on the Dashboard). Clock in/out from the embedded admin or your separate staff portal when available.

## Tips

- Mark employees inactive instead of deleting, to preserve history.
- Use [Support](/support) if you need help with setup.
'''
        props: '''return { as: "div", textType: "markdown" };'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "layout"
      L: PageLayout
      P: {
        componentName: ShopifyLayout
      }
    }
  ]
  edges: [
    {
      id: "e1"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "1"
      E: "2"
    }
    {
      id: "e2"
      T: "PageLayout"
      S: "1"
      E: "layout"
    }
    {
      id: "e3"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "2"
      E: "3"
    }
    {
      id: "e4"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "2"
      E: "4"
    }
    {
      id: "e5"
      T: "Attr"
      S: "2"
      E: "5"
    }
  ]
}

